OL,4,CRare Titanic items sell for record-    
OL,5,Cbreaking sums                          
OL,6,GRare items belonging to passengers of  
OL,7,Gthe Titanic have been sold at auction  
OL,8,Gfor record-breaking sums.              
OL,10,FThe highest selling artefacts were a   
OL,11,Fpocket watch from third-class          
OL,12,Fpassenger Mary Mangan, which fetched   
OL,13,F#250,000, and a diamond ring worn by   
OL,14,Ffamous passenger Lady Duff Gordon,     
OL,15,Fwhich was bought for #140,000.         
OL,17,FAnother item was a detailed, water-    
OL,18,Fstained letter recovered from the body 
OL,19,Fof its writer, first-class passenger   
OL,20,FRamon Artagaveytia Gomez, which was    
OL,21,Fauctioned for #80,000.                 
